      "title": "APTPUO - Winter 2027 - ESL4012-A",
      "description": "Posted: 2026-10-01\nPart time\n\nPosting Reason: New Position Location: Main Campus Academic Period: 2027 Winter Semester Faculty: Faculté des arts / Faculty of Arts Academic Unit: Institut des langues officielles et du bilinguisme \\\\ Official Languages and Bilingualism Institute (OLBI) Course Title: Teaching in Your Second Language (Intermediate/Advanced) Course Code: ESL4012 Section: A Course Description: This course is offered to all University of Ottawa professors who are members of the APUO or APTUO. During this discussion series professors will have the opportunity to practice speaking in their second official language while sharing insights on best teaching practices with their peers. Participants will be asked to discuss various topics related to teaching: • Past teaching experiences • Educational and technological tools and resources • Teaching methods, types of courses and their particularities • Teaching approaches and methods • Student learning assessment • Resources and services offered by the University of Ottawa *Once the class is completed, if the learner has actively participated in at least 80% of the meetings, they will be eligible for a one-hour individual session with the instructor to review their own classroom material for a course that they teach in their second language. From February 11 to April 8, 2027 (no course during reading week), Thursday, 12:00 p.m. to 1:30 p.m. Please note that this course is given online (virtual mode). Posting limited to: Instructeur de langue à temps partiel (ILOB) / Part-Time Language Instructor (OLBI) Date Posted (YYYY/MM/DD): 2026/10/01 Applications must be received BEFORE (YYYY/MM/DD): 2026/11/01 Expected Enrolment: 10 Approval date: 2026/10/01 Number of credits: 0 Work Hours: 12 Hourly Rate: ILOB - Cours de langue au personnel / OLBI - Personnel Language Courses: $115.43 (2024-2025) The academic year starts on September 1 and ends on August 31. These rates do not included vacation pay