      "description": "Posted: 2026-10-09\nPart time\n\nPosting Reason: New Position Location where work is to be performed: Main Campus Session: 2027 Winter Semester | Trimestre d'hiver Faculty: Faculté des sciences / Faculty of Science Unit: Department of Biology, Students & Casuals Job Classification: Teaching Assistant/Demonstrator/Lab Monitor (CUPE) Posting Type: Cours précis / Specific course Course Title: BIOSTATISTIQUES APPLIQUÉES Course Code: BIO4558/BIO5558 Section: A00,A01 Supervisor name (if known): James Santangelo Date Posted (YYYY/MM/DD): 2026/10/09 Applications must be received BEFORE (YYYY/MM/DD): 2026/10/23 Description of tasks (hours): Unless specified below, specific allocation of hours to various tasks should be articulated in a description of work negotiated and signed by you and the supervising professor prior to the commencement of work. Recherche / Research:0 Préparation / Preparation:1 Contact avec étudiants / Contact with Students:60 Correction - Notation / Grading:59 Surveillance / Proctoring:10 Formation / Training:0 Autre / Other:0 Number of positions: 3 Expected Enrolment: 110 Work Start Date: January 01, 2027 Work End Date: April 30, 2027 Total Work Hours: 130 Hourly Rate: AE-RA-Tuteur / TA-RA-Tutor : $33.83 ou/or $53.31 (Sept. 2026 - Aug. 2027) Undergraduate students will be paid at the lower rate; while graduate students will be paid at the higher rate. These rates do not include vacation pay nor statutory pay. Method of Delivery: In person Language of Work: Français | French Requirements and Nature of Work: Compétence avec le logiciel R et bonne connaissance des statistiques. Les labos auront lieu en personne le Jeudi de 11:30-14:20. Les heures de bureaux peuvent être bimodale. L'examen de mi-session aura lieu juste après la semaine de lecture. Il y aura 5 devoirs de labo à évaluer (~ 1 toutes les 2 semaines) Le matériel de cours est disponible à https://biostats-uottawa.github.io/bioXx58/fr/ Additional Information and/or Comments: 